    "evaluate": "J_k = team delay veh-s over [t0, t0+H): sum_t 0.5 s * sum_present max(0, 1 - v/31.29) of the predicted road vehicles (no source-waiting term unless an entry process is built from moment['counter']; then entrants count while on road). CRN: the WM rollout's lane-sampling uniforms for draw k are generated from sha256(seed, k, state digest) and shared by every action of the call; deterministic and repeatable (tested). Members (role 'hold'): a = clip((v_w - v)/1 s, -dmax, amax) for t in [start_s, start_s + hold_s) until the member passes release_x (global x) or the anchor passes anchor_release_x; WM native acceleration before/after; member lanes held except the WM first-passage merge in the lane-end zone (delegated). Non-member CAVs are native drivers (WM HDV law). Unknown member id / duplicate action ids / non-finite J raise wms.planapi.WMContractError.",
